# fields — шаги записи (что показывается — fields.md)
# Один этап: стартовый набор, команды next/previous трёх типов Field на одной строке.
# Дата Due — день записи: перезапись в другой день правит expect с датой.
title Fields | Step a tag, a date or a link through its Values with one key
open Task fields.md
caret - pay the rent
say Default: Status next → its Values in turn
cmd status-next
expect - #todo || pay the rent
cmd status-next
cmd status-next
expect - #done || pay the rent
say Priority next → a second tag, same Block
cmd priority-next
expect - #done #low || pay the rent
say Due next → today, then one day later
cmd due-next
expect - #done #low || pay the rent || 📅2026-10-04
cmd due-next
expect - #done #low || pay the rent || 📅2026-10-05
say Project next → a link to the note
cmd project-next
expect - #done #low || pay the rent || 📅2026-10-05 [[Project A]]
cmd project-next
expect - #done #low || pay the rent || 📅2026-10-05 [[Project B]]
say Status previous → one step back
cmd status-previous
expect - #doing #low || pay the rent || 📅2026-10-05 [[Project B]]
